WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:05.800
The archived Steno prototype.
Made-up content; nothing runs behind it.

00:06.900 --> 00:10.900
Select the limitation of liability clause.
The map refocuses and its inspector updates.

00:12.300 --> 00:15.800
Recenter on incident notice.
The review questions were written for the prototype.

00:16.800 --> 00:21.400
Open the Workstation tab.
